{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/b2eee536cb1768b93ec8b18779e2b759.avif?t=1758264586\" width=616 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Another busy day at the office, and you're one helpful, adorable dog!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruff Day At The Office is a delightfully funny game where you help your owner succeed through pure dog logic and good intentions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/8ab145ec0084729f87c0438179120831.poster.avif?t=1758264586\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/8ab145ec0084729f87c0438179120831.webm?t=1758264586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/8ab145ec0084729f87c0438179120831.mp4?t=1758264586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A devoted office dog</strong> (that's you!) who takes every wish seriously</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure dog logic solutions</strong> - If her owner wants something, Mochi will make it happen (somehow)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tasks to complete</strong> - Complete dog-logic tasks and see the hilarious chaos unfold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multi-floor office building</strong> - Ride the elevator to visit different office floors and help out various departments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Office full of possibilities</strong> - Find creative uses for everything from keyboards to coffee cups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to play</strong> - Simple controls that anyone can pick up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel-good fun</strong> \u2728 - Just love, good intentions, happy accidents, and plenty of laughs!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/87cdbf4b5ab5de0ccd7d19475a215804.poster.avif?t=1758264586\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/87cdbf4b5ab5de0ccd7d19475a215804.webm?t=1758264586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Mochi, the office's sweetest employee: lovable, enthusiastic, and ready to help however she can. Wishlist now for feel-good workplace humor!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562230?t=1758264586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3562230?t=1758264586","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/3d107efeab5c8d3c23ae0a681bbca2f34625bdb4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758264586","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/3d107efeab5c8d3c23ae0a681bbca2f34625bdb4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758264586","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3562230/extras/b2eee536cb1768b9